<title>UK: Saudi hikes Oct LPG prices by $25-35/tonne - trade.</title>
<headline>Saudi hikes Oct LPG prices by $25-35/tonne - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco hiked its liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) contract prices by $25-35 per tonne in October following sharp rises in spot markets, traders said on Monday. Propane rose $35 to $205 per tonne fob Gulf while butane jumped $25 to $205 per tonne.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
